  "description": "Delimited-file IDataSource companion for ToolUp.Platform. Reads CSV / TSV / pipe-delimited exports through IBlobStorage (any provider, including LocalFileStorage for files on disk), with configurable delimiter, quote character, header presence and encoding. Schema is inferred by type-probing a configurable row sample; Query re-emits canonical RFC 4180 CSV. Zero third-party dependencies — the RFC 4180 reader is BCL-only.",
